2\. the impact of violence, adverse exploitation, and Child neglect.
c. increasing the capacity of Child Protection services which includes development of institutional capacity and service providers.
d. service providers as referred to in letter c include:
1\. health;
2\. education;
3\. psychosocial;
4\. care; and
